<comment><![CDATA[Description of a range of values, usable for one or several attributes

Types Numeric, Text, Datetime, LOV, Group, Binary are to be understood as conceptional.
Real datatypes will be defined in the implementation of an information model

DOMA_ORIGIN:
- DOMain: 	this domain was defined as a named domain in the model
- DERived: this domain was not defined by a modeling person. It was derived from a attributes type-definition.
Therefore: every attribute as a domain. A default (derived) Domain "Unknown" will always exist.

Subtype of MODELELEMENT. DOMA_ID is always identical to the corresponding MODE_ID]]></comment>
